General Engine Service · 21-01-20}
Remove deposits from the piston surfaces. Clean gum or varnish from the piston skirt, piston pins and rings with solvent. Do not use a caustic cleaning solution or a wire brush to clean pistons. Clean the ring grooves with a ring groove cleaner (Fig. 45). Make sure the oil ring slots (or holes) are clean.


